  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A dual-ended blush brush that applies both cream and powder with ease for a diffused and glowy look.<br><b><br>Brush Formulation:</b> Cream and Powder<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This is a dual-ended blush brush that applies both cream and powder with ease for a diffused and glowy look. The fluffy end is great for lightly diffusing color, while the dense end is good for cream blushes.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use the fluffy end to lightly diffuse color onto the cheeks.<br>-Tap cream blush on with the dense end, to bring glow back to skin.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Cruelty-Free, Vegan, Synthetic Bristles / Fibers</div></details>",
